#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn about activity tracking events for IBM Quantum Compute Service."
msgstr "Erfahre mehr über Aktivitätsverfolgungsereignisse für IBM Quantum Compute Service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events for IBM Quantum Compute Service"
msgstr "Aktivitätsverfolgungsereignisse für IBM Quantum Compute Service"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events for IBM Quantum Compute Service {#activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"
msgstr "Aktivitätsverfolgungsereignisse für IBM Quantum Compute Service {#activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as IBM Quantum&reg; Compute Service, generate activity tracking events.\n"
msgstr "IBM Cloud&reg;-Dienste, wie IBM Quantum&reg; Compute Service, erzeugen Aktivitätsverfolgungsereignisse.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events report on activities that change the state of a service in IBM Cloud. You can use the events to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions and to comply with regulatory audit requirements.\n"
msgstr "Aktivitätsverfolgungsereignisse berichten über Aktivitäten, die den Zustand eines Dienstes in IBM Cloud ändern. Du kannst die Ereignisse nutzen, um ungewöhnliche Aktivitäten und kritische Aktionen zu untersuchen und um gesetzliche Prüfanforderungen zu erfüllen.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, a platform service, to route auditing events in your account to destinations of your choice by configuring targets and routes that define where activity tracking events are sent. For more information, see [About IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about).\n"
msgstr "Du kannst IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, einen Plattformdienst, verwenden, um Prüfereignisse in deinem Konto an Ziele deiner Wahl weiterzuleiten, indem du Ziele und Routen konfigurierst, die festlegen, wohin Aktivitätsverfolgungsereignisse gesendet werden. Weitere Informationen findest du unter [About IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use IBM Cloud Logs to visualize and alert on events that are generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr "Du kannst IBM Cloud Logs verwenden, um Ereignisse zu visualisieren und Benachrichtigungen dafür einzurichten, die in deinem Konto erzeugt und von IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing an eine IBM Cloud Logs-Instanz weitergeleitet werden.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Locations where activity tracking events are generated {#locations-where-activity-tracking-events-are-generated}"
msgstr "Standorte, an denen Aktivitätsverfolgungsereignisse erzeugt werden {#locations-where-activity-tracking-events-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service sends activity tracking events in the following regions:\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Compute Service sendet Aktivitätsverfolgungsereignisse in folgenden Regionen:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Washington (\"us-east\")\n"
msgstr "Washington (\"us-east\")\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Frankfurt (\"eu-de\")\n"
msgstr "Frankfurt (\"eu-de\")\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Viewing activity tracking events for IBM Quantum Compute Service {#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"
msgstr "Aktivitätsverfolgungsereignisse für IBM Quantum Compute Service anzeigen {#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Launching IBM Cloud Logs from the Observability page {#launching-ibm-cloud-logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr "IBM Cloud Logs über die Observability-Seite aufrufen {#launching-ibm-cloud-logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information on launching the IBM Cloud Logs UI, see the [Launching the UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) in the IBM Cloud Logs documentation.\n"
msgstr "Informationen zum Aufrufen der IBM Cloud Logs-Benutzeroberfläche findest du unter [Launching the UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) in der IBM Cloud Logs-Dokumentation.\n"

